# Environment
.env
.env.local

# The knowledge base is built locally from the official public site and is not
# redistributed here: raw responses are a local cache, the processed corpus and
# the search index are build artefacts. Only the original fixtures used by the
# tests are committed.
data/raw/
data/processed/
data/index/

# Evaluation key facts are derived from the official content, so they stay local
# too. Only the questions and the aggregate scores are committed.
eval/key_facts.local.jsonl

# Per-model scorecards are the resume point of a long answer evaluation. They
# hold per-question scores drawn from the local corpus, so they stay local.
eval/scorecards/

# Editors / OS
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
